--a mixture of 5 secretions of the cow for purifying the body;
1: M. ५६. 6; ५७, 5; ६०. १७; ६२. 8.
milk, curd, ghee, urine and dung of the cow, constituents;
2: Ib. २६६. 6; २६७. 5-6; वा. ११०. १५.
a panacea for stealing eatables, fruits and flowers, vehicles and beds;
3: M. २२७. ४४.
ablution of image to be installed by.
4: Ib. २६५. 8.

--five fires eligible for पार्वण s4ra1ddha;
1: वा. ८३. ५३; M. १६. 7.
performance of penance by ययाति for a year in the midst of five fires;
2: Ib. ३५. १६.
created by अग्निशर्मन् from his face. These are दक्षिणाग्नि, गार्हपत्य, आहवनीय, Sabhya, and आवसथ्य.
3: वा. १०६. ४१. 2.

